 "notes": "Manual, no committed spec (the OpenAPI is generated in CI). Recall from three controllers read whole (Backup, Devices, ItemUpdate); precision from the sample over the repo. H2-D10 measured: BaseJellyfinApiController carries [Route(\"[controller]\")], and 26 of the 60 controllers declare no [Route] of their own — their 128 extracted routes all miss /{Controller} (/Features instead of /Channels/Features) and their template-less actions ([HttpGet]) are dropped (inherited-route-attr). The other controllers declare [Route(\"\")] or [Route(\"System\")] and come out right. Calls (recall: SchedulesDirect.cs): ApiUrl = \"https://json.schedulesdirect.org/20141201\" is dropped as a base URL together with the /20141201 path it holds (const-base-url, H2-D12; same for AudioDb's BaseUrl with /api/v1/json/{key}); SendAsync(message) inside Request<T>(HttpRequestMessage message, ...) is resolved to a `message` variable of another method (variable-other-scope).",
